<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Verification Worksheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .header-table td { padding: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 36px; margin: 0;">KANSAS<br>WESLEYAN<br>UNIVERSITY</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0;">Office of Student Financial Planning,</h2>
      <p style="margin: 2px 0;">K-Dub Hub, Pioneer Hall 285,</p>
      <p style="margin: 2px 0;">100 E. Claflin, Salina, KS 67401</p>
      <p style="margin: 2px 0;">Telephone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span> | FAX: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">2021-22 Institutional Verification Worksheet – V1</h2>
  <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Independent (Contact: V1_GR_1)</h3>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Your FAFSA was selected by the U.S. Department of Education for a process called verification. The verification process will be conducted by Kansas Wesleyan University in accordance with U.S. Department of Education's rules 34 CFR Part 668. If you, or your spouse will not file taxes for 2019, please be sure to include amounts earned from work in Section B and attach copies of W-2 forms for all 2019 employers.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 15px;">We must collect this information before awarding Federal Financial Aid. No further processing will be done until all documentation is provided.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 3px;">SECTION A: STUDENT INFORMATION</h3>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Student Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;"><span data-field="student_first_name">{{ student_first_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Middle Initial</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">KWU Student ID # or Social Security Number</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Student Email address</td>
      <td style="width: 75%;">Student Cell Phone number</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 3px;">SECTION B: FAMILY INFORMATION</h3>
  <p>List the people in your household. Include:</p>
  <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><span data-field="household_member_1_description">{{ household_member_1_description }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="household_member_2_description">{{ household_member_2_description }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="household_member_3_description">{{ household_member_3_description }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">**********************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************</p>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Full Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Age</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Relationship to Student</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">College attending in 2021-22</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_names[0]">{{ household_member_names[0] }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_ages[0]">{{ household_member_ages[0] }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_relationships[0]">{{ household_member_relationships[0] }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_colleges[0]">{{ household_member_colleges[0] }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Office Use Only:</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">#</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center;"></td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Initials</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0;">SECTION C: INCOME INFORMATION</h3>
  <p>Tax returns are Federal 2019 IRS Form 1040, Puerto Rican Tax Return, or a foreign income tax return.</p>
  <p>Initial to the left on which of the circumstance that is true for you regarding your tax filing status for 2019.</p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">Re: Student's (and Spouse's) 2019 Tax and Income Information</h4>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 100%;">I/We used the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my/our 2019 income tax data into my FAFSA.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 100%;">I was unable to use the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my/our 2019 income tax data; therefore, I attached a copy of my/our 2019 IRS Tax Return Transcript OR a signed copy of my/our 2019 Tax Return (1040) and associated schedules. I understand that I must also provide a signed copy of a 2019 Tax Return for my spouse or significant other if he/she is listed in Section B of this form, even if we were not married in 2019 because we are currently married or living together.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 100%;">I/We have been granted an extension by the IRS beyond October for the 2019 tax year.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 100%;">I/We did not and will not file a 2019 U.S. Income Tax Return because (initial one option):</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-right: 10px;">I/We had zero earned or taxable income in 2019</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">I/We had too little taxable income to be required to file a tax return. Please complete the table below and attach a copy of all 2019 W-2 forms student.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Employer</th>
        <th style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">Amount earned in 2019</th>
        <th style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">W-2 Attached (Y/N)</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in income_items %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="income_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].employer_name">{{ income_items[loop.index0].employer_name }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="income_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ income_items[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="income_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].w2_attached">{{ income_items[loop.index0].w2_attached }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 3px;">SECTION D: SIGNATURES</h3>
  <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><strong>WARNING:</strong> If you purposely give false or misleading information in establishing eligibility for federal student aid, you may be subject to a Federal fine up to $20,000, a prison sentence, or both.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 25px;">By signing this worksheet, I (we) certify that all the information reported to qualify for federal student aid is complete and correct.</p>

  <table style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Student Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 33%; text-align: center;">Date</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Spouse Signature (Optional)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>